            "title": "中海油服季度淨利按年跌1.7%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">中海油田服務(01883)歸屬上市公司股東淨利12.24億元(人民幣‧下同)，按年跌1.7%，每股基本收益0.26元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">扣除非常損益淨利12億元，按年跌1.7%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"中信國際電訊官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/09/01883-Web.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"中信國際電訊官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/09/01883-Web.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">中信國際電訊官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">營業收入119.41億元，按年升3.5%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">首三季歸屬上市公司股東淨利32.33億元，按年跌0.7%，每股基本收益0.68元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">扣除非常損益淨利30.34億元，按年跌4.3%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">營業收入357.29億元，按年升2.5%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17034162-%e4%b8%ad%e6%b5%b7%e6%b2%b9%e6%9c%8d%e5%ad%a3%e5%ba%a6%e6%b7%a8%e5%88%a9%e6%8c%89%e5%b9%b4%e8%b7%8c1-7",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/07/20240313_FI_source-web_01883.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-10-23 17:57:46",
